# Lecture 09C

## Tetrad Analysis, Part 2

## Chapter 8

## Dr. Neil Voss

## November 3, 2026

=== layout: bookend

# Learning Objectives

@body

- Identify the parental combinations for each gene pair.
- Classify tetrads as PD, NPD, or TT for each pair.
- Test linkage and calculate pairwise map distances.
- Use the pairwise distances to construct a gene map.

