# *Tetrad Analysis*

@left

- [parental ditype]{color=#B47804} ([PD]{color=#B47804}) tetrad
  - AB AB ab ab
  - only parental genotypes are observed
- [nonparental ditype]{color=#00A933} ([NPD]{color=#00A933}) tetrad
  - Ab Ab aB aB
  - only recombinant genotypes are observed
- [tetratype (TT)]{color=#A1467E} tetrad
  - AB Ab aB ab
  - all four possible genotypes are present

@right

