- leu2 &#8211; trp1 (l and t)
  - [PD]{color=#B47804}\: 230 + 235 = 465
  - [NPD]{color=#00A933}\: 215 + 220 = 435
  - [TT]{color=#A1467E}\: 54 + 46 = 100
- For this pair of genes, [PD]{color=#B47804} = [NPD]{color=#00A933}, therefore, [leu2 and trp1 are unlinked.]{color=#FF4000}

