=== layout: bookend

# Key Takeaways

@body

- Start with the given parental genotypes.
- Consider two genes at a time and classify every tetrad.
- Compare PD with NPD before calculating linked-gene distances.
- Repeat for every pair, then use the distances to build the map.

=== layout: theend

# THE END
